caleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1001.png"}, {"id": 1002, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 02", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 1300, "y": 2700, "scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1002.png"}, {"id": 1003, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 03", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 2440, "y": 2700, "scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1003.png"}, {"id": 1004, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 04", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 3580, "y": 2700, "scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1004.png"}, {"id": 1005, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 05", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 4720, "y": 2700, "scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1005.png"}, {"id": 1006, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 06", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 5860, "y": 2700, "scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1006.png"}, {"id": 1007, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 07", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 7000, "y": 2700, "scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1007.png"}, {"id": 1008, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 08", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 8140, "y": 2700, "scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1008.png"}], "strokes": [], "notes": [{"id": 2999, "x": 11620, "y": 300, "text": "From a skeleton with a bell to the Trash Witch 💀🔔\n\nBehind the scenes of a Clash of Clans character I worked on. It started in July 2025 as the Artificer, a \"shepherd of debris\": one of the Witch's kids who summons Constructs from the rubble of destroyed buildings. No magic? No problem, hit the debris hard enough.\n\nIt went through a debris hammer, back to the bell, a turnaround and a 3D paintover, then pivoted into a Cleaner before landing as the Rubble Knight and Trash Witch.\n\nSwipe to see the whole journey →\n\n#clashofclans #supercell #characterdesign #conceptart #gameart #processwork #sketches\n\nDrive folder: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yWk7-c-nun3VscldZ6hiBKOB0QD0nCAA", "color": "#e9e6e2", "fontSize": 40}, {"id": 1999, "x": 9340, "y": 2700, "text": "How Skit & Dji were born 🛶\n\nThey took the longest to design of anyone in Megalith: doodles in 2022, a shortlist in June, views in August, the final concept in January 2023, then a comic-line redraw so they read well in small panels.\n\nWhich early version would you have picked?\n\nMegalith is a comic by Lizz Lunney (story) and Germán Reina (art). The full process is on Patreon: patreon.com/megalithislands\n\n#megalith #characterdesign #comicart #conceptart #processwork #sketchbook #indiecomics\n\nDrive folder: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EuWb-BCaXOrzRxfAl0hiB3VEN9SUvrWb", "color": "#e9e6e2", "fontSize": 40}], "shapes": [], "frames": [{"id": 2000, "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 13180, "h": 1900, "name": "2026-11-14 · Ruin Witch (instagram carousel)", "titleSize": 140, "titleBase": 140, "level": "body", "font": "Inter", "weight": 600}, {"id": 1000, "x": 0, "y": 2400, "w": 10900, "h": 1810, "name": "2026-11-14 · Skit & Dji design (instagram carousel)", "titleSize": 140, "titleBase": 140, "level": "body", "font": "Inter", "weight": 600}], "palettes": [], "storyboards": [], "layout": {"pane": {"cx": 6590.0, "cy": 950.0, "zoom": 0.12, "maximized": false, "type": "board", "state": {}}}}, "driveImages": {"2001": "1vaov1Jder15sGRhNGd7bwo-gTQPZcvQ_", "2002": "1NJ_FDiUj-lH2TcdJE8OnDfE9BtPp8ozg", "2003": "1mSQsv_MqJZ2rCWFr_a3tFAQu5QQdyFSY", "2004": "1b_wSITFyOutxS8LJ1vAIB7k8ESoIN_Rb", "2005": "134H7l0gHoTUf5NWu8LYiK_mByce69Wrn", "2006": "16oI_kcQC4GSaolmJaA8vwCKJp9unM_MR", "2007": "1czpuDrX3hRUKQq2BpqP6Ecq8aOhJkMm6", "2008": "1ZsN7HpHkuvJG6U9FbIk5Un-4dDDLZJ92", "2009": "1BzvtQyTMShptQDwixJ4yyqX6UH1DB_c4", "2010": "1_IYMWubq4qlduIIONsF2nFa7YzjCvPyO", "1001": "1ZtHI8KY9Bad67vgZLzE9Ok-MKj3YQe0h", "1002": "1wXKljsK65KbcdanLZOSGJ7RkfnTcUSxv", "1003": "1Q_7eHJKDPqpUpK4Pt9nGncoMzwEq14y8", "1004": "1Kbv2OGV_4c4sEZlT-Yo2xsxX2hhfqIlD"